nt.\n\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001\n- **Invoice:** INV-34060 (due 2026-11-04)\n- **Amount:** $7,058.54, the full invoice amount\n- **Status:** Sent\n\nThe amount is under $10,000, so it didn't need controller approval. Before sending, I checked the operating account and there were no earlier payments, so this isn't a duplicate. I also attached a unique key to the request so that if it were ever resent, it would only go through once.\n\nI didn't touch Granite's other two invoices. INV-28577 ($5,275.57) is already paid. INV-24483 ($6,826.80) is a draft still waiting for approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}